@DCC
Syntax: dcc [<opts>] <file>...
Usage : C compiler: dcpp, dcc68, dco68, las and llink
Opts  : -f=<path>  output program (a bare name goes to /dd/cmds)
        -r         stop at the .r object    -a  stop at assembly
        -w         check for errors only
        -dSYM[=v]  define SYM               -o  don't optimize
        -l=<file>  library                  -ls sys.l
        -n=<name>  module name              -s  no stack checks
        -T=<dir>   temporary files (default /dd/tmp)
        -H=<img>   make a header image from a file of #includes
        -h=<img>   take header declarations from an image
